            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "This part of the appendix lists XML schemas for data access, including the following:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "The "
                      },
                      {
                        "id": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "tx"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "monospace",
                        "roles": []
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": " Schema"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "data-access/appendix.html#xsd-schemas-tx"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "The "
                      },
                      {
                        "id": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "jdbc"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "monospace",
                        "roles": []
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": " Schema"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "data-access/appendix.html#xsd-schemas-jdbc"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "The "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "tx"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " tags deal with configuring all of those beans in Spring’s comprehensive support for transactions. These tags are covered in the chapter entitled "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Transaction Management"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "data-access/transaction.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "admonition",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "We strongly encourage you to look at the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "'spring-tx.xsd'"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " file that ships with the Spring distribution. This file contains the XML Schema for Spring’s transaction configuration and covers all of the various elements in the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "tx"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " namespace, including attribute defaults and similar information. This file is documented inline, and, thus, the information is not repeated here in the interests of adhering to the DRY (Don’t Repeat Yourself) principle."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null,
                "type": "tip"
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "In the interest of completeness, to use the elements in the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "tx"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " schema, you need to have the following preamble at the top of your Spring XML configuration file. The text in the following snippet references the correct schema so that the tags in the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "tx"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " namespace are available to you:"
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "listing",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<beans xmlns=\"http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans\"\n\txmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\"\n\txmlns:tx=\"http://www.springframework.org/schema/tx\" "
                  },
                  {
                    "guard": null,
                    "icons": null,
                    "id": "CO1-1",
                    "kind": "callout",
                    "number": "1",
                    "src": "",
                    "xml": false
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "\n\txmlns:aop=\"http://www.springframework.org/schema/aop\"\n\txsi:schemaLocation=\"\n\t\thttp://www.springframework.org/schema/beans\n\t\thttps://www.springframework.org/schema/beans/spring-beans.xsd\n\t\thttp://www.springframework.org/schema/tx\n\t\thttps://www.springframework.org/schema/tx/spring-tx.xsd "
                  },
                  {
                    "guard": null,
                    "icons": null,
                    "id": "CO1-2",
                    "kind": "callout",
                    "number": "2",
                    "src": "",
                    "xml": false
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "\n\t\thttp://www.springframework.org/schema/aop\n\t\thttps://www.springframework.org/schema/aop/spring-aop.xsd\">\n\n\t<!-- bean definitions here -->\n\n</beans>"
                  }
                ],
                "language": "xml",
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "colist",
                "id": null,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "blocks": [],
                    "checkbox": null,
                    "coids": [
                      "CO1-1"
                    ],
                    "icons": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Declare usage of the "
                      },
                      {
                        "id": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "tx"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "monospace",
                        "roles": []
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": " namespace."
                      }
                    ],
                    "src": ""
                  },
                  {
                    "blocks": [],
                    "checkbox": null,
                    "coids": [
                      "CO1-2"
                    ],
                    "icons": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Specify the location (with other schema locations)."
                      }
                    ],
                    "src": ""
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "style": "arabic",
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "admonition",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Often, when you use the elements in the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "tx"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " namespace, you are also using the elements from the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "aop"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " namespace (since the declarative transaction support in Spring is implemented by using AOP). The preceding XML snippet contains the relevant lines needed to reference the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "aop"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " schema so that the elements in the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "aop"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " namespace are available to you."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null,
                "type": "note"
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "xsd-schemas-tx",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
